      "text": "Derived from the BACI PRD/FRD — not yet reconciled with the Figma file. Tokens: ground #F5F3EE, ink #16181D, primary #0F5C4C, accent #A84F1F. Type: Fraunces display, Instrument Sans body. Bank names are fictional sandbox institutions.",
      "w": 300,
